// # BLAKE3 Fail-Closed Stubs
//
// Logline: Enforces fail-closed process exit barriers for unverified cryptographic operations in BLAKE3.
//
// Setup: Imports companion modules for fail-closed stub declarations.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import BLAKE3 engine and state types.
//   2. Trap unverified low-level primitives with process_exit(1).
//   3. Guard unaudited hardware acceleration and FFI routines.

import "./blake3_engine.oo";

